msgid ""
"These hooks provide an interface for controlling the operational state of IP "
"blocks. After acquiring a list of IP blocks for the GPU in use, the driver "
"can make chip-wide state changes by walking this list and making calls to "
"hooks from each IP block. This list is ordered to ensure that the driver "
"initializes the IP blocks in a safe sequence."
